==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kuromi (Enemy)|Kuromis]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~25.33 seconds<sup>400f~760f</sup>.
*1 [[Pochi (Enemy)|Pochi]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Nyamusu (Enemy)|Nyamusu]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kuromi (Enemy)|Kuromi]] spawns.
**1 [[Pochi (Enemy)|Pochi]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

